    <<run setFlag(_actor, _flag, _state)>>
<</widget>>

/* Flag DB:
    Story
        endJohn                 -   CH2, choose John's bad end
        endTasha                -   CH2, choose Tasha's bad end
        endSophie               -   CH2, choose Sophie's bad end
    
